  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Music tick on CIA 1 timer B. For each voice, starts a request and reads the music data when the note ends."},
    {"at":2,"placement":"side","text":"Tells the effects tick that the music tick is busy."},
    {"at":4,"placement":"side","text":"Bit 7 set: a new tune or sound waits for this voice."},
    {"at":11,"placement":"side","text":"Bit 7 clear: the voice plays nothing."},
    {"at":23,"placement":"side","text":"SID register offset of the voice."},
    {"at":28,"placement":"side","text":"The note time of the voice is not 0: no new event yet."},
    {"at":36,"placement":"line","text":"Points to the tune data at the read offset of the voice and reads one event."},
    {"at":66,"placement":"side","text":"Bytes $00-$bf are notes. Bytes $c0-$ff are commands."},
    {"at":72,"placement":"side","text":"Pitch = note * 2 (the table has quarter-tone steps)."},
    {"at":84,"placement":"side","text":"Counts down the note times and the fade delay."},
    {"at":90,"placement":"side","text":"Puts the master volume into the SID volume."},
    {"at":108,"placement":"side","text":"Bit 7 of music_stop_read set: the voice waits for the note time."},
    {"at":115,"placement":"line","text":"Starts a note on voice music_voice. A = pitch (0-$bf). Sets the frequency, effects, note time, filter sweep, pulse width and gate."},
    {"at":122,"placement":"side","text":"Pointer into the frequency table at $9ebb (2 bytes for each pitch)."},
    {"at":145,"placement":"side","text":"Loads the effect speed and the effect flags of the instrument."},
    {"at":157,"placement":"side","text":"Loads phase 0 of the effect steps of the voice."},
    {"at":180,"placement":"side","text":"Note time = note length of the voice."},
    {"at":196,"placement":"side","text":"Starts the filter sweep from its start cutoff."},
    {"at":216,"placement":"side","text":"Sets the pulse width of the instrument."},
    {"at":232,"placement":"side","text":"Clears the test bit and sets the gate."},
    {"at":240,"placement":"side","text":"The note uses 1 byte of data."}
  ],
